    "market/alert-banner-*.png": "a 1392x146 strip with no context; the same banner is visible at the top of the dashboard captures.",
    "market/briefing-*.png (element crop)": "the viewport capture of the same screen is used instead.",
    "market/reading-cape-light.png": "has no dark twin; reading-detail is used for the card.",
    "rin/icon.png": "an icon, not a screen.",
    "volbase/*.png without -light/-dark suffix": "the first-pass captures, superseded by the themed pairs.",
    "volbase/listing-usc-1440-*.png": "the page is a full-bleed photo of identifiable people; no realistic-scale framing avoids it, so the composition was dropped.",
    "volbase/opportunities-list-390-*.png": "the listing card photo of identifiable people sits mid-screen; a phone-shaped crop cannot avoid it, so the composition was dropped."
  }
